"現代的頂欄是系統玻璃，只能改圖示顏色；底部是浮動面板，書卡是點封面圓圈之後那張。未調整的部分跟隨目前的閱讀主題。" = "In Modern, the top bar uses system glass, so only its icon color can be changed. The bottom is a floating panel, and the book card is the panel that opens when you tap the cover circle. Anything you don't change follows the current reading theme.";
